{
  "mcp_servers": [
    {
      "id": "official-filesystem-workspace",
      "name": "MCP Filesystem（官方 @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem，需 Node/npx）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem",
        "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "official-mcp-fetch",
      "name": "MCP Fetch（官方 mcp-server-fetch，单 URL 抓正文）",
      "command": "__JACHIN_MCP_PYTHON__",
      "args": ["-m", "mcp_server_fetch"],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tavily-search",
      "name": "Tavily Search（联网检索，官方 MCP）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "tavily-mcp@latest"],
      "env": {
        "TAVILY_API_KEY": "${TAVILY_API_KEY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "maps_assistant",
      "name": "Google Maps MCP（地理编码、路线、周边地点；npm @modelcontextprotocol/server-google-maps）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-google-maps"
      ],
      "env": {
        "GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY": "${GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "com.jachin.mcp.office_powerpoint",
      "name": "Jachin Office PowerPoint MCP（PPTX，可选）",
      "command": "python",
      "args": ["-m", "ppt_mcp_server"],
      "env": {
        "PPT_TEMPLATE_PATH": "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__/ppt_templates"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sqlite_manager",
      "name": "SQLite 生活库 / 记账（PyPI mcp-server-sqlite，需 uv/uvx）",
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": [
        "mcp-server-sqlite",
        "--db-path",
        "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__/my_life_data.db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bilibili-mcp",
      "name": "Bilibili（@xzxzzx/bilibili-mcp · CC 字幕/高赞评论；Win 若裸 npx 失败见 _comment）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@xzxzzx/bilibili-mcp"
      ],
      "env": {
        "BILIBILI_SESSDATA": "${BILIBILI_SESSDATA}",
        "BILIBILI_BILI_JCT": "${BILIBILI_BILI_JCT}",
        "BILIBILI_DEDEUSERID": "${BILIBILI_DEDEUSERID}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "notion-remote-oauth",
      "name": "Notion 托管 MCP（Remote，OAuth；npm mcp-remote → https://mcp.notion.com/mcp）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "mcp-remote", "https://mcp.notion.com/mcp"]
    }
  ],
  "_comment": "复制到 ~/.jachin/mcp_servers.json 并与仓库 tools/mcp-official/mcp_servers.jachin.example.json 按需合并。bilibili-mcp：npm @xzxzzx/bilibili-mcp（工具 get_video_info / get_video_comments → mcp:get_*）；**必须**在 .env 配置 BILIBILI_SESSDATA / BILIBILI_BILI_JCT / BILIBILI_DEDEUSERID（对应浏览器 Cookie：SESSDATA、bili_jct、DedeUserID），并在本条 env 用 ${...} 注入，否则字幕/评论会报 Cookie 失效。**Windows** 若裸 npx 启动失败：将 command 改为 cmd.exe，args 改为 [\"/c\",\"npx\",\"-y\",\"@xzxzzx/bilibili-mcp\"]。若需 YouTube 字幕请自行添加 jkawamoto mcp-youtube-transcript（见文档），**不再**由 core/mcp_json_repair 自动注入。代理：.env 设 HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY。若仍保留旧版 npx @kimtaeyoon83 YouTube 条目，建议删除以免失败。Fetch 项：官方在 PyPI（pip install mcp-server-fetch），勿使用不存在的 npm 包 @modelcontextprotocol/server-fetch；默认遵守 robots.txt（如头条 /trending/ 会被拒）。需自担合规风险时可在 args 末尾加 \"--ignore-robots-txt\"，或设环境变量 JACHIN_MCP_FETCH_IGNORE_ROBOTS=1 由启动逻辑自动追加（见 core/mcp_json_repair.py）。Filesystem：__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__ 展开为 ~/.jachin/workspace。${TAVILY_API_KEY} / ${GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY} 从 .env 注入，勿把真实 Key 写入 Git。maps_assistant：见 modelcontextprotocol/servers-archived/src/google-maps（NPM @modelcontextprotocol/server-google-maps）。PowerPoint 需 pip install office-powerpoint-mcp-server。sqlite_manager：PyPI mcp-server-sqlite，需 uvx。notion-remote-oauth：Notion 官方托管 Remote MCP（OAuth），npm mcp-remote 桥接 https://mcp.notion.com/mcp；详见 docs/MCP_SPEC.md §3.5。"
}
